&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the&lt;strong&gt; Director, Solutions Engineering, East&lt;/strong&gt; for Grafana Labs, you will be responsible for all aspects of building and managing a team of high-performing Solution Engineers. You will be asked to be a cultural flag carrier for the organization and embody what strong partnership and collaboration looks like across AE and SE roles. You will help grow the East SE organization to 20+ SE’s and ensure we are prepared to scale the SE org across multiple products, industries, segments, and GTM motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paired with 3 Sales RVPs, 9 Sales RSDs, 47 AEs, 4 SEMs, 25 SEs, you will help evolve repeatable processes, playbooks, job architectures, enablement, and other programs needed to achieve this scale and increase win rates. You will be expected to be a thought leader, internally and externally, and ensure that feedback from the field makes its way into the product and GTM strategy.&amp;nbsp; Our ideal candidate is someone who is passionate about getting personally involved and helping to drive opportunities alongside the VP of Sales counterparts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture carrier who values the team over the individual and values; getting to the right answer is more important than being right&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to drive and advise on key opportunities alongside the VP of Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defaults to teamwork and collaboration; strong cross-functional relationship builder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensitivity and appreciation for open source and the bottom up motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing, excited, and able to engage with customers strategically&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, but not afraid of a healthy debate -- brings a strong point of view, but open to considering alternatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally Located on the East Coast of the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of experience in 2nd line SE leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling teams to over 30+ employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success working in a fast-paced, high growth startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in open source, developer-centric GTM motions, or observability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with complex, enterprise sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
