&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled Process Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify where AI tools and LLM-driven agents can take over manual, repetitive Incentive Compensation work such as exception detection, data reconciliation, plan document review, or answering common comp questions and build the workflows/integrations to put them into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with IC, Finance &amp;amp; Strategy, People Ops, Revenue Operations, and IT/Data teams to ensure incentive compensation systems are properly integrated, with clean, reliable data flowing between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear documentation, standard operating procedures, and controls for newly systematized processes, so they&#39;re auditable, maintainable, and don&#39;t regress back into manual work over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement Cadence:&lt;/strong&gt; Set up a repeatable process for the IC team to keep identifying and retiring manual work, as an ongoing discipline of finding the next bottleneck and fixing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the go-to resource translating IC process needs into system requirements, and translating system/data constraints back into practical process recommendations the team can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Support urgent, ad-hoc requests during payout cycles while keeping an eye on the long-term goal. Building yourself out of the fire-fighting role by systemizing the fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in incentive compensation, sales operations, revenue operations, or a related systems/process improvement role. Experience in a fast-paced technology or SaaS business is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated track record of finding manual, broken, or inefficient processes and systematizing them, not just documenting problems but building the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL &amp;amp; Data Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on SQL experience and comfort querying and reconciling data across systems to diagnose process gaps and validate automated outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience building automated workflows using tools such as scripting, workflow/RPA platforms, or ICM systems (e.g., Xactly, CaptivateIQ, Varicent, SPIFF platforms). Comfort standing up lightweight tools or integrations when off-the-shelf options fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with the core systems that touch incentive compensation: CRM (e.g., Salesforce), HRIS, data warehouses (e.g., BigQuery), and comp management platforms (e.g., Xactly) understanding how data moves between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills, with the ability to sit with a team, understand how they actually work day-to-day, and translate that into clear systems requirements and process changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of core comp mechanics (quotas, accelerators, SPIFFs, payout timing) sufficient to spot where a process breaks down or introduces risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry &amp;amp; Scale Context:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working in a high-growth SaaS, cloud, or open-source company, particularly within a public company or an environment undergoing IPO readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success working within globally distributed, remote-first organizations across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; LLM-Driven Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience documenting datasets and workflows for Model Context Protocol (MCP) server ingestion, or building AI skills/agents to automate incentive compensation data discovery, exception detection, or reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
