&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of fullstack engineering experience with strong frontend fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend experience, TypeScript and React. Backend experience, Go is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or operating distributed systems in production (e.g., Kafka, WarpStream, Apache Pinot, ClickHouse, Cassandra, Postgres)&lt;/li&gt;
