&lt;li&gt;Integrating cloud-partnership activities with AMER sales, partner, marketing, and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking and reporting partner activity, co-sell pipeline, and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
